"★ הזול\" (the cheap one).\n- **Which fund:** \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125\", number 5112628. It sits at the top of \"כל הקרנות על מדד ת\"א-125\" and is marked \"הבחירה\".\n- **How much:** \"86,045 ₪ נשאר לכם בעוד 10 שנים, אחרי דמי ניהול ומס, בכסף של היום\". That's from the \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\" I put in.\n\n**How sure I am:**\n- **Psagot:** fairly sure. It's top of the list and also wins in the steps chart lower down (\"הכי הרבה בכל המחירונים: 86,045 ₪\").\n- **The fund:** fairly sure. The second‑best pair is only \"‑1,030 ₪\" behind, so it's not a huge deal anyway.\n- **The final number:** not sure at all. It rests on \"תשואה בשנה 7%\", and the page itself says \"תשואה לדוגמה, לא תחזית\". Also, I didn't type in my own amounts. I left 10,000 now and 500 a month.\n- **What could change the answer:** I'm 24, and several banks show \"לא בחישוב · מחיר אחר לצעירים\". So Leumi, Discount or Hapoalim might actually be cheaper *for me*, and the page doesn't tell me.\n\n## 2. Parts I actually used\n\n- The top: the title \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\", the index buttons (I made sure \"ת\"א-125\" was picked), and the inputs \"סכום היום / הפקדה חודשית / תשואה בשנה\".\n- The result box: \"הפקדתם 70,000\", \"הבחירה שלכם · הזול 86,045\", and \"הזוג הבא בתור 85,015\".\n- The account list (1–15), mainly the names and the big \"נשאר\" number.\n- The fund card and the \"כל הקרנות על מדד ת\"א-125\" list, mainly the shekel number on the left.\n- The line \"הכי הרבה בכל המחירונים: 86,045 ₪, אי.בי.אי. מחקה… פסגות\" as a double‑check.\n\n## 3. Block by block\n\n1. **Title and intro.** Used it. It told me exactly what the page does: \"בוחרים חשבון ניירות ערך וקרן, ורואים כמה יישאר לכם\".\n2. **Index buttons (\"המדד\").** Used them, but only to check that 125 was selected. I skipped the others.\n3. **The \"מדד ת\"א-125 ישראלי\" explanation.** Skimmed it. \"עם תקרה למניה אחת\" meant nothing to me.\n4. **Amount, monthly deposit and return sliders.** Used them, but left the defaults. I didn't know whether 7% is normal, so I didn't touch it.\n5. **\"אינפלציה\" button and \"לדוגמה של האתר · בכסף של היום\".** Confused me. Is it on or off? Do I press it?\n6. **Result box (70,000 / 86,045 / 85,015).** Used it. This was the main thing for me.\n7. **\"כמה זה עולה לכם ב־10 שנים\" bar and legend.** Skimmed it. I saw \"7,323 ₪\" total and that the big pink part, \"מס\" (tax), is 5,555. I didn't understand the rest.\n8. **\"העלות אצלכם, לעומת הזוג השני\" (18 more, 1,390 less, 342 more).** Confused me. Why would I pay *more* tax and that's somehow good? (\"כי נשאר לכם יותר רווח\". OK, I sort of get it.)\n9. **Psagot card (\"מה החשבון גובה ב־10 שנים: 1,049 ₪\").** Used it.\n10. **Account list (screens 4–6).** Used it, top 3 carefully, then just scrolled. I read the grey \"לא בחישוב\" notes because of the \"צעירים\" ones. \"אינטראקטיב ישראל\" and \"Interactive Brokers\" with \"אין נתון\" I skipped.\n11. **Fund card (דמי ניהול 0.1%, נאמן 0.025%).** Skimmed it. I copied the number 5112628 and that's it.\n12. **Fund list.** Used the ₪ number on the left. The \"‑0.04% בשנה · שנה אחת\" line and the paragraph \"מול המדד…\" I read and didn't really get.\n13. **\"מה הכי משנה את מה שיישאר לכם\" line chart.** Skimmed it. The takeaway I got: keeping it in for more years (\"שנים\", +18,905) matters more than which bank. Nice, but it didn't help me choose.\n14. **\"מתחילים מבחירה אחת…\" steps chart.** Confused me. Why does it start from \"הראל סל… ירושלים\", which I never picked? And there Psagot's account cost shows as \"‑5,485\", while above it was 1,049. I only trusted the sentence saying the best is still Psagot + IBI מחקה.\n15. **\"עכשיו: …\" tables (accounts and funds again).** Skimmed them. They're the same ranking as before, with different numbers (84,932 instead of 86,045), which made me a bit nervous.\n16. **Small print, \"חוקים וכללים · 6\", and the footer.** Skimmed them. \"האתר לא ממליץ על מדד\" and \"נתונים נכון ל־05.11.2026\" were good to see.\n\n## 4. Lists, tables and charts\n\n- **Account list.**\n  - Looked at: the rank number, the bank name, the big bold \"נשאר\" number, \"★ הזול\", and the \"לא בחישוב\" notes.\n  - Glanced at: the small dotted number (1,049, 4,506…), which I guessed is the cost.\n  - Ignored: the coloured bars (orange, yellow, red, grey). I didn't go back up to the legend to decode them. I also ignored the round radio buttons and the ⌄ arrows.\n- **Fund list.**\n  - Looked at: the name, the \"‑1,030 ₪\" on the left, and the \"הבחירה\" label.\n  - Ignored: the fund numbers, the tags \"מדד ת\"א-125 / קרן סל / קרן מחקה\", the purple box icon, and the \"‑0.37% בשנה · שנה אחת\" lines.\n- **Cost bar.**\n  - Looked at: only the pink \"מס\" because it's the biggest, plus the total 7,323.\n  - Ignored: the green, orange and yellow parts.\n- **Line chart.**\n  - Looked at: the line labels \"שנים / הפקדה חודשית / תשואה בשנה / סכום היום\" and the table's last column \"ההפרש\".\n  - Ignored: the vertical line, the axis, and the \"20% יותר\" buttons.\n- **Steps chart.**\n  - Looked at: the three numbers 79,910 / +5,022 / +1,113.\n  - Ignored: the colour legend, the lock icon (\"נשען על כלל מס פתוח: מוצג ולא מדורג\"), and the ziggy line at the bottom.\n- **Purple dotted underlines everywhere:** I didn't know if I'm supposed to tap them.\n\n## 5. What I didn't understand\n\n- \"קרן מחקה\" vs \"קרן סל\". What's the difference, and does it matter how I buy it?\n- \"(4A)\", \"(40)\", \"MTF\" in the fund names.\n- \"דמי נאמן\", \"קבועים / משתנים\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"העמלות זו על זו\".\n- \"מול המדד… כמה הקרן הקדימה או פיגרה\" and the minus percentages.\n- \"בכסף של היום\" and the \"אינפלציה\" button.\n- Why Psagot's cost is 1,049 in one place and 5,485 in another, and 86,045 vs 84,932.\n- \"נשען על כלל מס פתוח\" and \"יש ספק אם נמכרת שם: וואן זירו\".\n- \"מחיר להוראת קבע\". Is that the monthly thing I want? Psagot doesn't say it.\n\n## 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n\n- Since I'm 24, do the \"מחיר אחר לצעירים\" price